{"id": "EUVD-2026-90749", "enisaUuid": "e8e6a3ec-6e42-3304-8306-ee495ebe010b", "description": "n8n versions before 1.123.80, from 2.0.0 before 2.39.6, and from 2.40.0 before 2.40.1 fail to verify the x-webflow-signature HMAC in the Webflow Trigger node webhook handler. Unauthenticated attackers can send forged webhook requests with attacker-controlled payloads to trigger workflows and manipulate downstream actions like record creation or API calls.", "datePublished": "2026-10-01T10:41:52", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-01T15:02:26", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/n8n-io/n8n/security/advisories/GHSA-hwv9-jhc7-f7c4", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/n8n-before-1.123.80-2.39.6-and-2.40.1-missing-webhook-signature-verification"], "aliases": ["GHSA-f4rh-5hw6-wc66", "CVE-2026-103245"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.16, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "379eb3b1-a490-31a1-8c96-3eb179d3cf3b", "product": {"name": "n8n", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}, "product_version": "2.0.0 <2.39.6"}, {"id": "9f6cef77-1925-306e-b718-2435ec03cddc", "product": {"name": "n8n", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}, "product_version": "0 <1.123.80"}, {"id": "ee9553cb-c882-3f3b-a0a9-b6a06221770f", "product": {"name": "n8n", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}, "product_version": "2.40.0 <2.40.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "d4968d9d-a350-3430-9a10-7fd7dcf0d4c9", "vendor": {"name": "n8n-io"}}], "isExploited": false}